  {
   "id": "plot-of-the-druid-126533@4.8.9",
   "gameId": "plot-of-the-druid-126533",
   "displayName": "Patch 4.8.9",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-04T09:31:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! 👋",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After the last patch, some players experienced low FPS and stuttering in various parts of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have identified the source of the problem and fixed it in this patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "This patch mainly affects",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Returning to the main menu from Chapter 1 no longer causes low FPS",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Switching languages no longer causes the game to freeze for a few seconds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New game loading times reduced by almost 50%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overall smoother and more stable gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚠️Reporting Issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any issues with the new version, please feel free to report them:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In our Discord Technical Support channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Or in our Community Forum, in the bug report thread",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will do our best to respond to and address any issues as soon as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To play the prologue & chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1108170/Plot_of_the_Druid\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]~ Adventure4Life Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
