  {
   "id": "plot-of-the-druid-126533@4.8.8",
   "gameId": "plot-of-the-druid-126533",
   "displayName": "Patch 4.8.8",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-01T22:21:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, all! 👋",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]While working on the new chapters, we’re also maintaining the current Steam version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your feedback is important to us, and we’re doing our best to address the issues you’ve reported.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠️ Patch 4.8.8 – Summary",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pierro no longer appears in places where he shouldn’t.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Direct navigation with the Firesquito: he no longer gets stuck at the potion room exit or moves off-screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed screen tearing that occurred when the camera was moving.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the save meta window keep showing after loading a save file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The ‘J’ shortcut now correctly toggles the inventory in and out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pixa text no longer overlaps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed controller navigation in the Difficulty Level menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a Unity security breach.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimization",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Textures now load only when needed, improving memory usage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The storm sequence at the start of Chapter 1 is now optimized and uses less memory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Visual Fixes & Improvement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The shrink-head cutscene now displays correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved visibility for all UI icons, including the HUD, hotspot interactions, and inventory items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Their contrast has been enhanced, and their resolution doubled—so they now appear sharper and less pixelated, especially on larger screens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠️ Important Note",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your older save files may not work properly after the upgrade, so please keep that in mind.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any issues with the new version, feel free to report them in our Discord Technical Support Channel channel. We're here to help.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎯 Next Goal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are aiming to release two new chapters in mid-2026 — here’s a small glimpse of what’s coming:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dsCBChvOkiU\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "General Fixes in Progress",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Mouse support while a controller is connected – we’re working on a proper solution for this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "A few missing voice lines – these will be added with the release of the new chapters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "About the Development",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you’d like to learn more about the development, you can follow our Kickstarter updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36089082/2f38c4b8ba7dd46c16ae6ed19e7da1653a3d150d.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "~ Adventure4Life Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
